# PoE2 Knowledge Base Global Rules (Fate of the Vaal / v0.4+)

## Core Context
- **Game**: Path of Exile 2 (PoE2).
- **Current League**: **Fate of the Vaal** (Version 0.4+).
- **Target Audience**: **Expert Players**. Assume the reader knows all basic mechanics, currency, and map slotting rules.

## Documentation Style
- **Concise & Focused**: Prune all "how-to" basic guides. Provide dense, high-level reference data (tables, regex, tiers).
- **End-Game Only**: All strategies must focus on **T15+ farming** and high-tier returns.
- **Expert Terminology**: Use technical jargon (e.g., "juice", "fishing", "Tribute Engine", "Logbook Velocity").
- **Visual Scannability**: Use Markdown tables for map lists, boss drops, and tablet priorities. 1 row per item in tables.
- **Actionable Tools**: Always provide **Stash Tab Regex** for high-end filtering.

## Technical Requirements
- **Absolute Paths**: Always use absolute paths for file operations.
- **Research First**: For any new guide, research specifically for the current league (v0.4+).
- **Directory Specifics**: Refer to the specific rule files in \`.cursor/rules/\` for directory-specific logic.
